Admin APIs (Rules Management)

Rule Create API : 

POST /api/v1/rules
Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Content-Type: application/json


Request :

{
  "scope": "GLOBAL / SERVICE / ENDPOINT",
  "service": "payment-service",         // null if GLOBAL
  "endpoint": "/payments/initiate",     // null if GLOBAL or across all endpoints of Payment Service i.e at Payment- servvice level
  "entity_type": "USER / IP / API_KEY / DEVICE / IDENTIFIER",
  "tier": "FREE / PREMIUM / ENTERPRISE", // null if not USER, or if all tiers to have same limit or tier classificatuon itslef is niot a part of architecture
  "limit": 100,
  "window_seconds": 60,
  "algorithm": "TOKEN_BUCKET / FIXED_WINDOW / SLIDING_LOG / SLIDING_COUNTER / LEAKY_BUCKET",
  "enabled": true
}


Response (201 Created)

{
  "rule_id": "rule-abc-123",
  "scope": "GLOBAL / SERVICE / ENDPOINT",
  "service": "payment-service", // null if GLOBAL
  "endpoint": "/payments/initiate", // null if GLOBAL or across all endpoints of Payment Service i.e at Payment- servvice level
  "entity_type": "USER / IP / API_KEY / DEVICE / IDENTIFIER", 
  "tier": "FREE / PREMIUM / ENTERPRISE", // null if not USER, or if all tiers to have same limit or tier classificatuon itslef is niot a part of architecture
  "limit": 100,
  "window_seconds": 60,
  "algorithm": "TOKEN_BUCKET / FIXED_WINDOW / SLIDING_LOG / SLIDING_COUNTER / LEAKY_BUCKET",
  "enabled": true,
  "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:30:00Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-02T10:30:00Z",
  "created_by": "admin-101"
}


Validation rules : 

scope=GLOBAL but service non-null  -> Error : 400 — GLOBAL me service nahi
scope=SERVICE but service null -> Error : 400 — service required
scope=ENDPOINT but endpoint null	-> Error : 400 — endpoint required
entity_type ≠ USER but tier present  -> Error : 400 — tier only for USER
limit <= 0 -> Error : 400 
window_seconds <= 0 -> Error : 400 


Unique constraint (DB):

UNIQUE (scope, service, endpoint, entity_type, tier)



